{
  "_note": "节气(22):当前节气 + 下一个节气几天后 + 当前一候。数据 day.df。",
  "rc": {
    "cells": [
      {
        "id": "bg",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "0pt",
        "y": "0pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}",
        "h": "{parent.h}",
        "bgColor": "#FFFFFF|#15171A"
      },
      {
        "id": "dot",
        "type": "layer",
        "x": "12.0pt",
        "y": "{hd.y}+({hd.h}-5pt)/2",
        "w": "5pt",
        "h": "5pt",
        "bgColor": "#C8402F|#F2735F",
        "cornerRadius": {
          "leftT": "2.5pt",
          "leftB": "2.5pt",
          "rightT": "2.5pt",
          "rightB": "2.5pt"
        },
        "_note": "源色点(card-design-system §2):朱砂,每张组件恰好一次。"
      },
      {
        "id": "hd",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "21.0pt",
        "y": "11pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-33.0pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "lineBreak": "0",
        "text": "${@i18n.term}",
        "fontSize": "13pt",
        "typeface": "System-Bold",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
      },
      {
        "id": "now",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "12.0pt",
        "y": "34pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "text": "${@i18n.nowIs}",
        "fontSize": "11pt",
        "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "jqz",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12.0pt",
            "y": "48pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${jqNow},--)]",
            "fontSize": "30pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#128F66|#6FE8BE"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "jqe",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12.0pt",
            "y": "50pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "2",
            "lineBreak": "0",
            "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${jqNow},--)]",
            "fontSize": "17pt",
            "typeface": "System-Bold",
            "textColor": "#128F66|#6FE8BE"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "nx",
        "type": "txt",
        "x": "12.0pt",
        "y": "96pt",
        "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
        "h": "-1",
        "maxLines": "1",
        "lineBreak": "0",
        "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${jqNext},--)] · $[findNotEmpty::(${jqIn},--)]${@i18n.dAfter}",
        "fontSize": "12pt",
        "textColor": "#0E1116|#F3F4F6"
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),1,0)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "hou",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12.0pt",
            "y": "122pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "lineBreak": "0",
            "text": "$[if::(eq::(${houI},1),${@i18n.h1},if::(eq::(${houI},2),${@i18n.h2},${@i18n.h0}))] · $[findNotEmpty::(${hou},--)]",
            "fontSize": "11pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "_note": "三候原文(《逸周书·时训解》)"
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "type": "op",
        "action": "if",
        "props": {
          "val": "$[if::(startsWith::(${@app.language},zh),0,1)]"
        },
        "react": [
          {
            "id": "houE",
            "type": "txt",
            "x": "12.0pt",
            "y": "122pt",
            "w": "{parent.w}-24pt",
            "h": "-1",
            "maxLines": "1",
            "lineBreak": "0",
            "text": "$[findNotEmpty::(${hou},--)]",
            "fontSize": "11pt",
            "textColor": "#6B7280|#8E939B",
            "_note": "英文只放意译一句(cncal HOU_EN,≤ 22 字符),不带「Pentad N ·」前缀 —— 带上就超 134pt 被截断"
          }
        ]
      }
    ],
    "i18n": {
      "zh-CN": {
        "term": "节气",
        "nowIs": "现在是",
        "dAfter": " 天后",
        "h0": "初候",
        "h1": "二候",
        "h2": "三候"
      },
      "en-US": {
        "term": "Solar term",
        "nowIs": "Now",
        "dAfter": "d",
        "h0": "Pentad 1",
        "h1": "Pentad 2",
        "h2": "Pentad 3"
      }
    }
  }
}
